From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bench Fixture <bench@example.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 19:32:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rate limit the ping REST view

Enforce pingRateLimit: a singleton limiter counts the pings of each
project in one-minute windows and the REST view answers 429 Too Many
Requests once a project is over its limit. The SSH command is left
alone, it is only used interactively.
